<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="kauyon"><h2>Kauyon <span class="detachment-dp">2DP</span></h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="kauyon-stratagems" data-track="kauyon-stratagems"><h4 class="subheading">Stratagems</h4><div class="detachment-grid stratagem-grid"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-a-tempting-trap"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-a-tempting-trap" data-term-title="A TEMPTING TRAP" data-term-summary="Your Shooting phase. One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. The first time you use this Stratagem, you must also select one objective marker that is not in your opponent’s deployment zone; until the end of the battle, this becomes your Trap objective marker. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit within range of your Trap objective marker, add 1 to the Wound roll. You cannot use this Stratagem during the first or second battle rounds." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kauyon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kauyon.html#detachment-kauyon">A TEMPTING TRAP</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. The first time you use this Stratagem, you must also select one objective marker that is not in your opponent’s deployment zone; until the end of the battle, this becomes your Trap objective marker.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit within range of your Trap objective marker, add 1 to the Wound roll.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>You cannot use this Stratagem during the first or second battle rounds.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-combat-embarkation"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-combat-embarkation" data-term-title="COMBAT EMBARKATION" data-term-summary="Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit has declared a charge. One T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY unit from your army that was selected as one of the targets of that charge, and one friendly TRANSPORT. Your unit can embark within that TRANSPORT. If it does, your opponent can select new targets for that charge. Every model in your T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY unit must be within 3&quot; of that TRANSPORT and there must be sufficient transport capacity to embark the entire unit." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kauyon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kauyon.html#detachment-kauyon">COMBAT EMBARKATION</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit has declared a charge.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY unit from your army that was selected as one of the targets of that charge, and one friendly TRANSPORT.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit can embark within that TRANSPORT. If it does, your opponent can select new targets for that charge.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>Every model in your T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY unit must be within 3&quot; of that TRANSPORT and there must be sufficient transport capacity to embark the entire unit.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-coordinate-to-engage"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-coordinate-to-engage" data-term-title="COORDINATE TO ENGAGE" data-term-summary="Your Shooting phase. One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that has just been selected as an Observer unit (see For the Greater Good). Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets their Spotted unit, improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of that attack by 1 and, if your unit has the MARKERLIGHT keyword, that attack has the [IGNORES COVER] ability." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kauyon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kauyon.html#detachment-kauyon">COORDINATE TO ENGAGE</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that has just been selected as an Observer unit (see For the Greater Good).</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets their Spotted unit, improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of that attack by 1 and, if your unit has the MARKERLIGHT keyword, that attack has the [IGNORES COVER] ability.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-photon-grenades"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-photon-grenades" data-term-title="PHOTON GRENADES" data-term-summary="Your opponent’s charge phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its charge target. One T’AU EMPIRE GRENADES unit from your army that was selected as one of the targets of that charge. That enemy unit must immediately take a Battle-shock test, and until the end of the phase, subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for that enemy unit. You cannot target a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kauyon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kauyon.html#detachment-kauyon">PHOTON GRENADES</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s charge phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its charge target.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE GRENADES unit from your army that was selected as one of the targets of that charge.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>That enemy unit must immediately take a Battle-shock test, and until the end of the phase, subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for that enemy unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>You cannot target a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-point-blank-ambush"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-point-blank-ambush" data-term-title="POINT-BLANK AMBUSH" data-term-summary="Your Shooting phase. One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit within 9&quot;, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1. You cannot use this Stratagem during the first or second battle rounds." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kauyon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kauyon.html#detachment-kauyon">POINT-BLANK AMBUSH</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets an enemy unit within 9&quot;, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>You cannot use this Stratagem during the first or second battle rounds.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-wall-of-mirrors"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-wall-of-mirrors" data-term-title="WALL OF MIRRORS" data-term-summary="End of your opponent’s Fight phase. One STEALTH, GHOSTKEEL or COMMANDER SHADOWSUN unit from your army. Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves. You cannot target a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kauyon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kauyon.html#detachment-kauyon">WALL OF MIRRORS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>End of your opponent’s Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One STEALTH, GHOSTKEEL or COMMANDER SHADOWSUN unit from your army.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>You cannot target a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.</p></article></div></section></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements" hidden><section class="detachment-part" id="kauyon-enhancements" data-track="kauyon-enhancements"><h4 class="subheading">Enhancements</h4><div class="detachment-grid"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-exemplar-of-the-kauyon" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Exemplar of the Kauyon"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-exemplar-of-the-kauyon" data-term-title="Exemplar of the Kauyon" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE model only (excluding KROOT SHAPER models). While the bearer is leading a unit, the Patient Hunter Detachment rule applies to that unit from the second battle round onwards instead of from the third." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kauyon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kauyon.html#detachment-kauyon">Exemplar of the Kauyon</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE model only (excluding KROOT SHAPER models). While the bearer is leading a unit, the Patient Hunter Detachment rule applies to that unit from the second battle round onwards instead of from the third.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-precision-of-the-patient-hunter" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Precision of the Patient Hunter"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-precision-of-the-patient-hunter" data-term-title="Precision of the Patient Hunter" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE model only. Each time the bearer makes a ranged attack, add 1 to the Hit roll. From the third battle round onwards, add 1 to the Wound roll as well." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kauyon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kauyon.html#detachment-kauyon">Precision of the Patient Hunter</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE model only. Each time the bearer makes a ranged attack, add 1 to the Hit roll. From the third battle round onwards, add 1 to the Wound roll as well.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-solid-image-projection-unit" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Solid-image Projection Unit"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-solid-image-projection-unit" data-term-title="Solid-image Projection Unit" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE model only. After both players have deployed their armies, select up to three T’AU EMPIRE units from your army and redeploy them.…" data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kauyon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kauyon.html#detachment-kauyon">Solid-image Projection Unit</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE model only. After both players have deployed their armies, select up to three T’AU EMPIRE units from your army and redeploy them. When doing so, you can set those units up in Strategic Reserves if you wish, regardless of how many units are already in Strategic Reserves.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-through-unity-devastation" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Through Unity, Devastation"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 30 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-through-unity-devastation" data-term-title="Through Unity, Devastation" data-term-summary="T’AU EMPIRE model only (excluding KROOT SHAPER models). While the bearer is leading a unit, each time that unit is an Observer unit, until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in a Guided unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability while targeting their Spotted unit." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kauyon" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kauyon.html#detachment-kauyon">Through Unity, Devastation</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">T’AU EMPIRE model only (excluding KROOT SHAPER models). While the bearer is leading a unit, each time that unit is an Observer unit, until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in a Guided unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability while targeting their Spotted unit.</p></article></div></section></div></section>
<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="kroot-hunting-pack"><h2>Kroot Hunting Pack <span class="detachment-dp">2DP</span></h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><section class="detachment-part" id="kroot-hunting-pack-stratagems" data-track="kroot-hunting-pack-stratagems"><h4 class="subheading">Stratagems</h4><div class="detachment-grid stratagem-grid"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-a-trap-well-laid"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-a-trap-well-laid" data-term-title="A TRAP WELL LAID" data-term-summary="Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase. One KROOT unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase. After your unit has resolved its attacks this phase, select one enemy unit that was hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the end of the phase, each time a KROOT model from your army makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, unless the attacking unit is Battle-shocked, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">A TRAP WELL LAID</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One KROOT unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>After your unit has resolved its attacks this phase, select one enemy unit that was hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the end of the phase, each time a KROOT model from your army makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, unless the attacking unit is Battle-shocked, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-emp-grenades"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-emp-grenades" data-term-title="EMP GRENADES" data-term-summary="Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy VEHICLE unit is selected to shoot or fight. One KROOT GRENADES unit from your army within 8&quot; of that enemy VEHICLE unit. Until the end of the phase, worsen the Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill characteristics of that enemy VEHICLE unit’s weapons by 1." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">EMP GRENADES</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy VEHICLE unit is selected to shoot or fight.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One KROOT GRENADES unit from your army within 8&quot; of that enemy VEHICLE unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, worsen the Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill characteristics of that enemy VEHICLE unit’s weapons by 1.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-guerrilla-warriors"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-guerrilla-warriors" data-term-title="GUERRILLA WARRIORS" data-term-summary="Your Movement phase, just after a KROOT unit from your army Falls Back. That KROOT unit. Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">GUERRILLA WARRIORS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Movement phase, just after a KROOT unit from your army Falls Back.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>That KROOT unit.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-hidden-hunters"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-hidden-hunters" data-term-title="HIDDEN HUNTERS" data-term-summary="Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets. One KROOT unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks. Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18&quot;." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">HIDDEN HUNTERS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One KROOT unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18&quot;.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-join-the-hunt"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-join-the-hunt" data-term-title="JOIN THE HUNT" data-term-summary="Any phase. One KROOT INFANTRY or KROOT HOUNDS unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed. Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength. This Stratagem cannot be used to return destroyed CHARACTER units to Attached units. You can only use this Stratagem once per battle." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">JOIN THE HUNT</button></h3></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Any phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One KROOT INFANTRY or KROOT HOUNDS unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="restrictions"><b>Restrictions</b><br>This Stratagem cannot be used to return destroyed CHARACTER units to Attached units. You can only use this Stratagem once per battle.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-the-grisly-feast"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-the-grisly-feast" data-term-title="THE GRISLY FEAST" data-term-summary="Fight phase. One KROOT unit from your army that destroyed one or more enemy units this phase. In your opponent’s next Command phase, each enemy unit within 6&quot; of your unit must take a Battle-shock test. If the unit taking that test is Below Half-strength, subtract 1 from that test. Enemy units affected by this Stratagem do not need to take any other Battle-shock tests in the same phase." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">THE GRISLY FEAST</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One KROOT unit from your army that destroyed one or more enemy units this phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>In your opponent’s next Command phase, each enemy unit within 6&quot; of your unit must take a Battle-shock test. If the unit taking that test is Below Half-strength, subtract 1 from that test. Enemy units affected by this Stratagem do not need to take any other Battle-shock tests in the same phase.</p></article></div></section></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements" hidden><section class="detachment-part" id="kroot-hunting-pack-enhancements" data-track="kroot-hunting-pack-enhancements"><h4 class="subheading">Enhancements</h4><div class="detachment-grid"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-borthrod-gland" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Borthrod Gland"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-borthrod-gland" data-term-title="Borthrod Gland" data-term-summary="Kroot Flesh Shaper only. While the bearer is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">Borthrod Gland</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">Kroot Flesh Shaper only. While the bearer is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-kroothawk-flock" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Kroothawk Flock"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-kroothawk-flock" data-term-title="Kroothawk Flock" data-term-summary="KROOT model only. Ranged weapons equipped by models in the bearer’s unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability, and enemy units that are set up on the battlefield as Reinforcements cannot be set up within 12&quot; horizontally of the bearer." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">Kroothawk Flock</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">KROOT model only. Ranged weapons equipped by models in the bearer’s unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability, and enemy units that are set up on the battlefield as Reinforcements cannot be set up within 12&quot; horizontally of the bearer.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-nomadic-hunter" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Nomadic Hunter"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 20 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-nomadic-hunter" data-term-title="Nomadic Hunter" data-term-summary="KROOT TRAIL SHAPER model only. While the bearer is leading a unit, add 3&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit and ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [ASSAULT] ability." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">Nomadic Hunter</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">KROOT TRAIL SHAPER model only. While the bearer is leading a unit, add 3&quot; to the Move characteristic of models in that unit and ranged weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [ASSAULT] ability.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-root-carved-weapons" data-enhancement-tags="" data-owner-subject="model" data-enhancement-title="Root-carved Weapons"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-enhancement-root-carved-weapons" data-term-title="Root-carved Weapons" data-term-summary="Kroot War Shaper model only. All weapons equipped by the bearer have the [PRECISION] and [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] abilities." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/kroot-hunting-pack.html#detachment-kroot-hunting-pack">Root-carved Weapons</button></h4><p data-source-field="text">Kroot War Shaper model only. All weapons equipped by the bearer have the [PRECISION] and [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] abilities.</p></article></div></section></div></section>
