s an attack that targets the closest enemy unit, you can re-roll the Wound roll." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">COMBAT DEBARKATION</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY unit from your army that disembarked from a TRANSPORT this turn.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets the closest enemy unit, you can re-roll the Wound roll.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="stratagem-counterfire-defence-systems"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tau-empire-stratagem-counterfire-defence-systems" data-term-title="COUNTERFIRE DEFENCE SYSTEMS" data-term-summary="Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets. One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks. Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack." data-full-rule-path="books/tau-empire/reader.html#detachment-montka" data-mobile-rule-path="books/tau-empire/mobile/montka.html#detachment-montka">COUNTERFIRE DEFENCE SYSTEMS</button></h3></div><div class="cp">2CP</div></div><p class="field" data-source-field="when"><b>When</b><br>Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="target"><b>Target</b><br>One T’AU EMPIRE unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.</p><p class="field" data-source-field="effect"><b>Effect</b><br>Until the end of the phase, 